  <h1>iLLaDA: A Diffusion LLM That Actually Matches Autoregressive Models</h1>
  <p class="lead">Autoregressive LLMs generate tokens one at a time, left-to-right — they can never revise a choice based on what comes after. iLLaDA trains a fully bidirectional diffusion model from scratch on 12T tokens, masking and restoring tokens simultaneously, and reaches performance competitive with Qwen2.5 7B on general and math benchmarks — proving that the autoregressive paradigm isn't the only path to strong language models.</p>
