</section>

<!-- Listen-friendly content -->
<div class="listen-friendly-content" style="display:none;" aria-hidden="true">
  <div lang="en">
    <h2>Audio Summary: iLLaDA — Improved Large Language Diffusion Models</h2>
    <p>iLLaDA is an 8-billion parameter language model trained using masked diffusion rather than the usual autoregressive approach. Instead of predicting tokens left-to-right, it starts with all tokens masked and uses fully bidirectional attention to predict all of them simultaneously. The model was trained from scratch on 12 trillion tokens — over five times more than the previous LLaDA model — and achieves an average benchmark score of 63.9 percent, edging out the autoregressive Qwen2.5 7B at 63.3 percent.</p>
    <p>Key innovations include grouped-query attention to reduce memory overhead, tied input and output embeddings, a variable-length block generation scheme for open-ended output, and a novel confidence-based scoring method for multiple-choice evaluation. The model also benefits from long supervised fine-tuning: training on a 25-billion token instruction corpus for 12 epochs produces substantially better results than single-epoch fine-tuning, a property consistent with the "super data learner" hypothesis for diffusion models. The instruct model reaches 67.1 percent average, trailing Qwen2.5 7B Instruct mainly due to the absence of reinforcement learning alignment, which the authors leave for future work.</p>
  </div>
  <div lang="zh">
    <h2>语音摘要：iLLaDA——改进的大型语言扩散模型</h2>
    <p>iLLaDA是一个80亿参数的语言模型，采用掩码扩散方法而非常见的自回归方式进行训练。与从左到右逐个预测词元不同，该模型从全部词元被遮蔽的状态出发，利用完全双向注意力机制同时预测所有词元。模型从头开始在12万亿词元上训练——超过前代LLaDA模型的五倍——在基准测试中取得63.9%的平均分，略超过自回归模型Qwen2.5 7B的63.3%。</p>
    <p>关键创新包括：分组查询注意力（降低内存开销）、输入输出嵌入共享、用于开放式生成的变长块生成方案，以及一种用于多项选择评估的置信度得分方法。模型还受益于长时间的监督微调：在250亿词元的指令语料库上训练12轮，效果显著优于单轮微调。这与扩散模型是"超强数据学习者"的假说一致。指令微调模型平均达到67.1%，与Qwen2.5 7B指令模型的差距主要源于缺少强化学习对齐，这部分工作留待后续研究。</p>
  </div>
</div>

